WEBVTT

00:05:26.289 --> 00:05:31.127
And as humans, we don't have the ability
to recognize when we're being biased,

00:05:31.161 --> 00:05:33.697
even if we can see it in other people.

00:05:33.697 --> 00:05:37.767
We all, most of us, anyway,
believe ourselves to be fair,

00:05:37.801 --> 00:05:40.070
open-minded and unbiased.

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:44.875
And yet, I will admit,
I too found Hillary's voice to be shrill.

00:05:44.908 --> 00:05:50.146
As long as society continues to associate
leadership with masculine traits,

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.515
female leaders
will be judged more harshly,

00:05:52.549 --> 00:05:54.985
even when they outperform
male counterparts.

00:05:55.752 --> 00:05:57.854
So it's no wonder
that in the United States,

00:05:57.888 --> 00:06:00.624
female politicians suffer greatly,